{"id":"u-6ecf70d8-ada2-4b79-8cf2-03d085cc20dc","src":"community","title":"Broly's Rage Mutant Program","author":"Tuomas S.","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/uBl8Vx-brolys-rage-mutant-program","desc":"BROLY’S RAGE MUTANT PROGRAM is not built for mere mortals or low-class warriors content with average gains; this 12-week hyper-intensive crucible is engineered for one definitive purpose: to shatter your genetic limiters and force your body into a state of absolute, unadulterated Mutant Hypertrophy. We are not here to build a sleek, balanced physique—we are here to forge an imposing, terrifying wall of muscle that radiates pure power, forcing an undeniable \"Mutant Illusion\" that screams dominance the second you step into any room.Every single training block in this routine has been mathematically optimized to focus on your maximum structural weapons. The first weapon is the Tear-Drop Quadricep Carnage, which utilizes deep, mechanical violence via specialized Hack Squats and Pendulum setups to stretch and tear the lower thigh fibers, building massive, explosive pillars. Next comes the Saiyan Armor Chest & Width, transitioning from heavy mechanical presses to deep, stretch-mediated dumbbell training to widen your ribcage and pack layers of thick, striated armor across your upper chest. For the upper body frame, we unleash the Front-Facing Mutant V-Taper, executing heavy, strict rows and tactical pulldowns to flare out your lats like a spaceship, broadening your skeletal frame from the front. Finally, we target the Unapologetic Mutant Details with dedicated, high-frequency obliteration for a thick, choke-proof neck and dense, vascular forearms—ensuring you look like an absolute freak of nature even in an XL t-shirt.This program operates strictly on the law of Dynamic Double Progression (DDP) and precise RPE tracking. You will not blindly chase random numbers; instead, you will systematically load the barbell, control the grueling 3-second negative descents, and hunt down maximum mechanical tension within the $8-12$ rep range. We have completely stripped away the garbage volume that drains your power, leaving only pure, dense, high-intensity sets that force your Central Nervous System to adapt or break. You will push your body to the absolute brink of Zenkai boosts week after week, followed by a strategic, calculated Deload to allow your muscles to rebuild bigger, denser, and more monstrous than ever before. Your power level is fluctuating, and your current genetic form is holding you back; therefore, it is time to stop lifting like a human, fuel the rage, embrace the absolute devastation of the iron, and claim your destiny as the Legendary Mutant. MAXIMUM POWER IS COMING.","level":["Advanced","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle"],"equipment":["Full Gym"],"minutes":90,"joins":11,"rate":0,"rateCount":1,"updated":"2026-10-09T20:59:07.013Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Broly's Massive Day","Broly's Monster Day","Massive Ruhl Day","Master Roshi Max Power"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Chest Press (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":10,"hi":12,"rpe":9,"x":5}]},{"n":"Pec Deck (Machine)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hack Squat","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Supported Row Wide Grip","sets":[{"r":8,"rpe":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"behind back bicep curl","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Overhead Tricep Extension (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":4}]},{"n":"Side Neck W/ Rubberband","sets":[{"lo":15,"hi":20,"rpe":8,"x":3}]},{"n":"Standing Dumbell Lateral Raise Strict","sets":[{"lo":12,"hi":15,"rpe":9,"x":4}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Pull Ups Wide Grip W/Extraweight","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":9,"x":3}]},{"n":"Romanian Deadlift (Barbell)","sets":[{"lo":8,"hi":10,"rpe":8.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Close Grip Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":8.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Dumbell Overhead Press (Sitting)","sets":[{"r":10,"rpe":8.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Reverse Bicep Curl (EZ Bar)","sets":[{"r":12,"rpe":9.5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Calf